 ## Operating characteristics
-- Time Complexity: $O(N \cdot R)$ for collecting intersecting points, where $N$ is the number of points and $R$ is the number of rays (pixels). Sorting and accumulation are $O(k \log k + k)$ per pixel, which is negligible for small $k$ [S1].
-- Memory Complexity: $O(N)$ for storing point attributes and $O(R \cdot k)$ for pixel buffers [S1].
